#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create access groups and policies"
msgstr "Buat grup akses dan kebijakan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create access groups and policies {#create-access-groups-and-policies}"
msgstr "Buat grup akses dan kebijakan {#create-access-groups-and-policies}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create an instance in IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, an access group is automatically generated for collaborators to use that instance. If you want to customize that access group or create other access groups, use the IBM&reg; Cloud console for [Access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr "Saat kamu membuat instance di IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, grup akses otomatis dibuat agar kolaborator bisa menggunakan instance tersebut. Kalau kamu ingin menyesuaikan grup akses itu atau membuat grup akses lain, gunakan konsol IBM&reg; Cloud untuk [Grup akses](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An _access group_ contains _policies_, which define the actions that access group members can take on specific resources, such as services.  In this guide, the resource is generally an IBM Quantum _service instance_.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah _grup akses_ berisi _kebijakan_, yang mendefinisikan tindakan apa saja yang bisa dilakukan anggota grup akses pada sumber daya tertentu, seperti layanan. Dalam panduan ini, sumber dayanya umumnya adalah sebuah _instance layanan_ IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can create additional access groups by using the IBM Cloud&reg; [console](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui), [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=cli), [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=api), or [Terraform](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=terraform).\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa membuat grup akses tambahan menggunakan IBM Cloud&reg; [konsol](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui), [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=cli), [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=api), atau [Terraform](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=terraform).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Important\">\n"
#| "To determine the actions allowed by each role, from the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) page, select Qiskit Runtime in the dropdown menu at the top of the page.  For a more detailed list, click the number in the column next to the role name.  For example, by visiting that page and clicking the number by the Manager role, you can see that this role includes the ability to delete a job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"To determine the actions allowed by each role, from the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) page, select Quantum Compute in the dropdown menu at the top of the page.  For a more detailed list, click the number in the column next to the role name.  For example, by visiting that page and clicking the number by the Manager role, you can see that this role includes the ability to delete a job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Penting\">\n"
"Untuk mengetahui tindakan apa saja yang diizinkan oleh setiap peran, dari halaman [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles), pilih Qiskit Runtime di menu dropdown di bagian atas halaman. Untuk daftar yang lebih rinci, klik angka di kolom di samping nama peran. Misalnya, dengan mengunjungi halaman tersebut dan mengklik angka di samping peran Manager, kamu bisa melihat bahwa peran ini mencakup kemampuan untuk menghapus job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Compare pre-defined service role actions](#compare-actions) section provides a comparison of the pre-defined Manager, Writer, and Reader roles.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Bagian [Bandingkan tindakan peran layanan yang telah ditentukan](#compare-actions) memberikan perbandingan antara peran Manager, Writer, dan Reader yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-ibm-quantum-administrators\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-ibm-quantum-administrators\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group {#create-an-ibm-quantum-administrators-access-group}"
msgstr "Buat grup akses IBM Quantum Administrators {#create-an-ibm-quantum-administrators-access-group}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "After setting up an account for your organization, it's recommended that you create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group. This access group lets other users create and manage instances, and manage user access for the Qiskit Runtime service.\n"
msgid "After setting up an account for your organization, it's recommended that you create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group. This access group lets other users create and manage instances, and manage user access for IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "Setelah menyiapkan akun untuk organisasimu, disarankan untuk membuat grup akses IBM Quantum Administrators. Grup akses ini memungkinkan pengguna lain untuk membuat dan mengelola instance, serta mengelola akses pengguna untuk layanan Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create this access group, include the following policies:\n"
msgstr "Saat membuat grup akses ini, sertakan kebijakan-kebijakan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Qiskit Runtime service - Grant access to manage all IBM Quantum instances in the account and view account usage analytics.\n"
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service - Grant access to manage all IBM Quantum instances in the account and view account usage analytics.\n"
msgstr "Layanan Qiskit Runtime - Berikan akses untuk mengelola semua instance IBM Quantum di akun dan melihat analitik penggunaan akun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Manager** service access role\n"
msgstr "Peran akses layanan **Manager**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Administrator** platform management access role\n"
msgstr "Peran akses manajemen platform **Administrator**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All account management services - Grant access to list all the resource groups in the account.\n"
msgstr "Semua layanan manajemen akun - Berikan akses untuk melihat semua grup sumber daya di akun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Viewer** platform management access role\n"
msgstr "Peran akses manajemen platform **Viewer**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All IAM Account Management services - Grant access to invite users, manage access groups, and create access policies.\n"
msgstr "Semua layanan Manajemen Akun IAM - Berikan akses untuk mengundang pengguna, mengelola grup akses, dan membuat kebijakan akses.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Center service - Grant access to enable users to open support cases through IBM Cloud Support Center.\n"
msgstr "Layanan Support Center - Berikan akses agar pengguna bisa membuka kasus dukungan melalui IBM Cloud Support Center.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Users with the `viewer` platform management role on \"all account management services\" can also view services such as billing. If you want to prevent this extra view access, use the IBM Cloud CLI to give them access to just Resource groups:\n"
msgstr "  Pengguna dengan peran manajemen platform `viewer` pada \"semua layanan manajemen akun\" juga bisa melihat layanan seperti penagihan. Jika kamu ingin mencegah akses tampilan tambahan ini, gunakan IBM Cloud CLI untuk memberi mereka akses hanya ke grup Sumber Daya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these examples to create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group by using the IBM Cloud CLI or console.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti contoh-contoh berikut untuk membuat grup akses IBM Quantum Administrators menggunakan IBM Cloud CLI atau konsol.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cli\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cli\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud CLI {#use-the-ibm-cloud-cli}"
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud CLI {#use-the-ibm-cloud-cli}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To create an _access group_ by using the CLI, use the [`ibmcloud iam access-group-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create) command.\n"
msgstr "Untuk membuat _grup akses_ menggunakan CLI, gunakan perintah [`ibmcloud iam access-group-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To create an access group _policy_ by using the CLI, use the [`ibmcloud iam access-group-policy-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create) command.\n"
msgstr "Untuk membuat _kebijakan_ grup akses menggunakan CLI, gunakan perintah [`ibmcloud iam access-group-policy-create`](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-ibmcloud_commands_iam#ibmcloud_iam_access_group_policy_create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the following JSON code to create policies for an Administrators access group:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan kode JSON berikut untuk membuat kebijakan bagi grup akses Administrators:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Account Management services (viewer)\n"
msgstr "Semua layanan Account Management (viewer)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Qiskit Runtime Service (Manager, Administrator)\n"
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service (Manager, Administrator)\n"
msgstr "Layanan Qiskit Runtime (Manager, Administrator)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All IAM Account Management services (administrator)\n"
msgstr "Semua layanan IAM Account Management (administrator)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Center service (administrator)\n"
msgstr "Layanan Support Center (administrator)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"ui\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"ui\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud IAM console {#use-the-ibm-cloud-iam-console}"
msgstr "Gunakan konsol IBM Cloud IAM {#use-the-ibm-cloud-iam-console}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an account owner or administrator, follow these steps to create an IBM Quantum Administrator access group.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai pemilik atau administrator akun, ikuti langkah-langkah berikut untuk membuat grup akses IBM Quantum Administrator.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to Manage > [Access (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/overview) in the IBM Cloud console.\n"
msgstr "Pergi ke Manage > [Access (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/overview) di konsol IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the left panel in the **Manage access** section, click **Access groups**, then click **Create**.\n"
msgstr "Di panel kiri pada bagian **Manage access**, klik **Access groups**, lalu klik **Create**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the **Create access group** window that opens, add a name and description that represent the group of users that you will invite.  For example, IBM Quantum Administrators. Click **Create**.\n"
msgstr "Di jendela **Create access group** yang terbuka, tambahkan nama dan deskripsi yang mewakili kelompok pengguna yang akan kamu undang. Misalnya, IBM Quantum Administrators. Klik **Create**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "Next, create policies for the Qiskit Runtime service,  for All IAM Account Management services, and for All Account Management services.\n"
#| "1. In the access group just created, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign access**.\n"
#| "1. In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
#| "   - **Service** - Search for Qiskit Runtime and select it. Click **Next**.\n"
#| "   - **Resources** - Select **All resources**. Click **Next**.\n"
#| "      Note: If you were creating a policy that you want to apply only to a certain instance, you would instead choose **Specific resources**, **Service instance**, **string equals**, then select the instance.\n"
#| "   - **Roles and actions** - Select the following values:\n"
#| "      - For **Service access**, select  **Manager**.\n"
#| "      - For **Platform access**, select **Administrator**.\n"
msgid ""
"Next, create policies for IBM Quantum Compute Service, for All IAM Account Management services, and for All Account Management services.\n"
"1. In the access group just created, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign access**.\n"
"1. In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
"   - **Service** - Search for Quantum Compute and select it. Click **Next**.\n"
"   - **Resources** - Select **All resources**. Click **Next**.\n"
"      Note: If you were creating a policy that you want to apply only to a certain instance, you would instead choose **Specific resources**, **Service instance**, **string equals**, then select the instance.\n"
"   - **Roles and actions** - Select the following values:\n"
"      - For **Service access**, select  **Manager**.\n"
"      - For **Platform access**, select **Administrator**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, buat kebijakan untuk layanan Qiskit Runtime, untuk All IAM Account Management services, dan untuk All Account Management services.\n"
"1. Di grup akses yang baru dibuat, klik tab **Access**, lalu klik **Assign access**.\n"
"1. Di halaman **Create policy** yang terbuka, definisikan elemen-elemen berikut:\n"
"   - **Service** - Cari Qiskit Runtime dan pilih. Klik **Next**.\n"
"   - **Resources** - Pilih **All resources**. Klik **Next**.\n"
"      Catatan: Jika kamu membuat kebijakan yang hanya ingin diterapkan pada instance tertentu, kamu sebaiknya memilih **Specific resources**, **Service instance**, **string equals**, lalu pilih instance-nya.\n"
"   - **Roles and actions** - Pilih nilai-nilai berikut:\n"
"      - Untuk **Service access**, pilih **Manager**.\n"
"      - Untuk **Platform access**, pilih **Administrator**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   At the bottom, click **Add**. You should see the policy on the right-hand panel. Click **Assign** at the bottom of that panel.\n"
msgstr "   Di bagian bawah, klik **Add**. Kamu akan melihat kebijakan di panel sebelah kanan. Klik **Assign** di bagian bawah panel tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You have successfully created an access group with one policy.  Next, create a second policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Kamu telah berhasil membuat grup akses dengan satu kebijakan. Selanjutnya, buat kebijakan kedua untuk instance yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the same access group, click the **Access** tab, then click **Assign access**.\n"
msgstr "Di grup akses yang sama, klik tab **Access**, lalu klik **Assign access**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the **Create policy** page that opens, define these elements:\n"
msgstr "Di halaman **Create policy** yang terbuka, definisikan elemen-elemen berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **All IAM Account Management services**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Service** - Pilih **All IAM Account Management services**. Klik **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Administrator**, Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - Untuk Platform access, pilih **Administrator**, Klik **Next**.\n"
"   Di bagian bawah, klik **Add**, lalu klik **Assign**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a third policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Buat kebijakan ketiga untuk instance yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **All Account Management services**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Service** - Pilih **All Account Management services**. Klik **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Viewer**, Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - Untuk Platform access, pilih **Viewer**, Klik **Next**.\n"
"   Di bagian bawah, klik **Add**, lalu klik **Assign**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a fourth policy for the same instance.\n"
msgstr "Buat kebijakan keempat untuk instance yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service** - Select **Support Center**. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "**Service** - Pilih **Support Center**. Klik **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - For Platform access, select **Administrator**. Click **Next**.\n"
"   At the bottom, click **Add**, then click **Assign**.\n"
msgstr ""
"   - **Roles and actions** - Untuk Platform access, pilih **Administrator**. Klik **Next**.\n"
"   Di bagian bawah, klik **Add**, lalu klik **Assign**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, add users to the access group.  You can do this from the access group's **Users** page, or by using the IBM Quantum Platform [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/access-groups) page.\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, tambahkan pengguna ke grup akses. Kamu bisa melakukannya dari halaman **Users** grup akses, atau menggunakan halaman [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/access-groups) di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can only invite users who are already members of the account.  If you don't see a user on the Add users page, follow the steps in [Invite and manage users](/guides/invite-and-manage-users#invite) to add them to the account first.  After they accept the invitation, you can add them to the access group.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kamu hanya bisa mengundang pengguna yang sudah menjadi anggota akun. Jika kamu tidak melihat pengguna di halaman Add users, ikuti langkah-langkah di [Undang dan kelola pengguna](/guides/invite-and-manage-users#invite) untuk menambahkan mereka ke akun terlebih dahulu. Setelah mereka menerima undangan, kamu bisa menambahkan mereka ke grup akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare permissions {#compare-permissions}"
msgstr "Bandingkan izin {#compare-permissions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following table displays which permissions are granted to three entities: account owners, IBM Quantum Administrators (see the [Create an IBM Quantum Administrators access group](#create-ibm-quantum-administrators) section), and instance collaborators (a \"Collaborators\" access group is automatically generated whenever you create an instance using IBM Quantum Platform).\n"
msgstr "Tabel berikut menampilkan izin apa saja yang diberikan kepada tiga entitas: pemilik akun, IBM Quantum Administrators (lihat bagian [Buat grup akses IBM Quantum Administrators](#create-ibm-quantum-administrators)), dan kolaborator instance (grup akses \"Collaborators\" otomatis dibuat setiap kali kamu membuat instance menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key:\n"
msgstr "Keterangan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "✅ Has permission\n"
msgstr "✅ Memiliki izin\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "✴️ Involves a dependency\n"
msgstr "✴️ Melibatkan ketergantungan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "❌ Does not have permission\n"
msgstr "❌ Tidak memiliki izin\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Permissions | Account owner | IBM Quantum Administrators (access group) | Instance collaborators (access group) |\n"
#| "| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
#| "| Full access to all IBM Cloud resources | ✅| ✅ (*Only to Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ❌ (*Only to a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*)| \n"
#| "| Assign access to others | ✅| ✅ (*Only to Qiskit Runtime service*)| ❌| \n"
#| "| Create service instances  | ✅ (*All IBM Cloud catalog*)| ✅ (*Only Qiskit Runtime service instances*)| ❌| \n"
#| "| View all users | ✅| ✅| ✴️ (*Depends on user visibility settings*)| \n"
#| "| Set user visibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
#| "| Invite users to the account | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
#| "| Billing responsibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
#| "| View billing information | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
#| "| Owner notifications | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
#| "| Submit quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*) | \n"
#| "| View quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*)| \n"
#| "| Cancel quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Qiskit Runtime instance*)| \n"
#| "| Delete quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*)| ✅ (*On all Qiskit Runtime instances*) | ❌| \n"
#| "| Create support cases | ✅| ✅ (*If the access policy is included in the access group*) | ✅ (*If the access group gives access to a Premium Plan instance*)| \n"
#| "| Configure an [identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/identity-providers) to connect your external user repositories to your IBM Cloud account | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
msgid ""
"| Permissions | Account owner | IBM Quantum Administrators (access group) | Instance collaborators (access group) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Full access to all IBM Cloud resources | ✅| ✅ (*Only to Quantum Compute instances*)| ❌ (*Only to a particular Quantum Compute instance*)| \n"
"| Assign access to others | ✅| ✅ (*Only to IBM Quantum Compute Service*)| ❌| \n"
"| Create service instances  | ✅ (*All IBM Cloud catalog*)| ✅ (*Only Quantum Compute instances*)| ❌| \n"
"| View all users | ✅| ✅| ✴️ (*Depends on user visibility settings*)| \n"
"| Set user visibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Invite users to the account | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Billing responsibility | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| View billing information | ✅| ✅| ❌| \n"
"| Owner notifications | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
"| Submit quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Quantum Compute instance*) | \n"
"| View quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Quantum Compute instance*)| \n"
"| Cancel quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*Only on a particular Quantum Compute instance*)| \n"
"| Delete quantum workloads | ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*)| ✅ (*On all Quantum Compute instances*) | ❌| \n"
"| Create support cases | ✅| ✅ (*If the access policy is included in the access group*) | ✅ (*If the access group gives access to a Premium Plan instance*)| \n"
"| Configure an [identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/identity-providers) to connect your external user repositories to your IBM Cloud account | ✅| ❌| ❌| \n"
msgstr ""
"| Izin | Pemilik akun | IBM Quantum Administrators (grup akses) | Kolaborator instance (grup akses) |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Akses penuh ke semua sumber daya IBM Cloud | ✅| ✅ (*Hanya ke instance Qiskit Runtime*)| ❌ (*Hanya ke instance Qiskit Runtime tertentu*)|\n"
